{"id":"steam-1358970","steam":1358970,"igdb":null,"type":"game","title":"Spaceflight Factory","summary":"SpaceFlight Factory is an Automation and Base Building game with some survival game mechanics.\r\nYou lead a small colony of human remnants. Help them to survive, expand and gather enough resources to leave Earth for their new home planet.","about":"SpaceFlight Factory is an Automation and (moving) Base Building inspired by Factorio and Stardeus.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nOn a post-apocalyptic Earth, all cities and settlements have been ravaged by pollution and a hostile biosphere.\r\nIn a last hope to salvage Earth, a crew of the best astronauts have been sent to a remote planet to collect a mysterious ore capable of turning Earth's destiny.\r\n\r\nRebuild an assembly line with conveyor belts, factory(s), foundry(s), insertor(s)... while defending your base from nearby swarms of Zorglings and rebuild an industry capable of launching spacecrafts and sending the supplies back to Earth.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nWith this new hope, you lead a colony of human remnants. Help them survive, expand and gather enough resources to leave Earth for their new home planet... The game also includes some incremental/idle game mechanics.","cover":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1358970/library_600x900.jpg?t=1699560229","coverFallback":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1358970/header.jpg?t=1699560229","banner":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1358970/library_hero.jpg?t=1699560229","header":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1358970/header.jpg?t=1699560229","background":null,"screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1358970/ss_eb4f98495f20a8e214acc0eee11a15f0377edbb2.600x338.jpg?t=1699560229","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1358970/ss_eb4f98495f20a8e214acc0eee11a15f0377edbb2.